    "title": "Man arrested in Council Bluffs apartment shooting that seriously hurt woman - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mike Bell ,\n3 hours ago\nOMAHA, Neb. (WOWT) - A man has been arrested in a Council Bluffs shooting that left a woman seriously hurt. Sean Ewing, 30, is booked into the Pottawattamie County Jail. Earlier this week, police issued an arrest warrant for charges including attempt to commit murder. The shooting happened Friday night...\nRead full article\n1",
